+## Configuration
+
+Lines 93-96 define exactly `<mpy><k>run($PGM,$ARGS)</k></mpy>`. There are no
+store, heap, stack, I/O, allocation, exception, or other state cells. The
+read-only local environment needed by this program is an explicit `Map`
